  "description": "Stage F's font substitution table. A requested family resolves to a bundled family: its own name first, then a substitution, an alias or a generic name. A family named nowhere here is unmapped: host bytes are accepted only when the host's face has the requested name, otherwise the content family substitutes. Every face file lives beside this file. The build generates a fixed record array from it (cmake/FontSubstitution.cmake); C# and Web.Forms read the same file. An exception names a gate criterion a measured style may fail, and its limit: advances (mismatched code points), line_breaks (differing paragraph line-break sets over every size), line_height (px) or line_width (largest absolute mean deviation at any size).",
